<title>CHINA: China Jan-Oct oil imports up 43.6 pct yr-on-yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Oct oil imports up 43.6 pct yr-on-yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>China imported 18.41 million tonnes (of crude oil in the first 10 months, up 43.6 percent compared with the year-ago period, customs figures showed on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Crude oil imports in October alone were 2.73 million tonnes.</p>
<p>China's crude oil exports in the first 10 months reached 16.54 million tonnes, up 8.7 percent compared with the same year-ago period, the figures showed.</p>
<p>Exports in October alone were 2.64 million tonnes.</p>
</text>
